From 3a635f26e934bd111874ee0501e22239ed3d2871 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Balazs Rozgonyi <rbhun@me.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 14:55:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat: output multiple audio tracks

Add normalization.audio.tracks to the channel config (schema 0.1.6) and
tracks.extra_audio to playout items (schema 0.0.9). Extra tracks read from
the primary audio input, get the same audio filters and are tagged with
their language and title; slots an item can't fill are silent so the track
layout never changes between items.

Scope the forced ac3 downmix decoder to the primary stream so other audio
streams in the same input keep their own decoder.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
